# core.autocrlf is enabled on Windows checkouts, and without these rules Git
# guesses at content type. It guessed "text" for the e2e PDF fixture, which
# would rewrite line endings inside the binary and corrupt it on clone.
# Mark the binary fixture formats explicitly so they round-trip byte-for-byte.

*.pdf   binary
*.xlsx  binary
*.xls   binary
*.wav   binary
*.mp3   binary
*.m4a   binary
*.flac  binary
*.ogg   binary
*.webm  binary
